            "detailed_description": "Certifique-se de adicionar as luzes noturnas à sua lista de desejos Steam!<br><br>Perfure a escuridão e entre em Night Lights (Luzes Noturnas).<br><br>Use a luz para sua vantagem para cortar as sombras.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/ebd9b5a4c7fb6144b28820f31498d4ac.poster.avif?t=1766087960\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/ebd9b5a4c7fb6144b28820f31498d4ac.webm?t=1766087960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/ebd9b5a4c7fb6144b28820f31498d4ac.mp4?t=1766087960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Resolva enigmas intrincados usando sombras e luz.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/05074351a7b80aef472619d32d2a62b1.poster.avif?t=1766087960\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/05074351a7b80aef472619d32d2a62b1.webm?t=1766087960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/05074351a7b80aef472619d32d2a62b1.mp4?t=1766087960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Percorra níveis para colecionar cristais que ativam inúmeras ferramentas e fontes de luz.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/78ca683a6dff7afb198eec21fbcf4b96.poster.avif?t=1766087960\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590850/extras/78ca683a6dff7